  "_nonTransactionReadme": "LR-04/LR-05/NR-01: words that make a message not a money movement ONLY when it names no money movement anywhere (no moneyKeywords word and no debit/credit direction): links, calls to action, complaint lines, further promotions, and account notices (credit limit, card activation/renewal, statements, PIN, beneficiary). A bank SMS puts these on real purchases, salaries and fees, so they never make the AI candidate validator reject a message that does name one. PR-02: they never make a message IGNORED either: with no money word the message is left unresolved (deterministicParse), for the AI and its validator. A word inside the merchant span ('Offer Mart') does not count. With ignoreKeywords equal, as a set, to the device's securityIgnoreWords + promotionWords + ignoreMarkers (drift test transaction_state_cues_drift_test.dart); the account notices are noticeKeywords (OR-01).",
